    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n81133" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περίβᾰσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιβαίνω</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>going round, circuit</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>GDI</u>
				5075.72
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Crete</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐρανοῦ ταχύτητα τὴν περὶ ταῦτα π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Corp.Herm.</u>
				5.5
			</span></i> codd.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσχίσθω ὁ ἱμὰς τὴν ἀμφὶ
				τὸ οὖς περίβασιν</span> let the bandage be slit <i>so as
				to go round</i> the ear, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				33
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				18(1).754
			</span></i>.</div>
